				<r3d:description language="eng">NASA Life Sciences Portal is the next generation of the Life Sciences Data Archive for Human, Animal and Plant Research
NASA&#039;s Human Research Program (HRP) conducts research and develops technologies that allow humans to travel safely and productively in space. The Program uses evidence from data collected on astronauts, as well as other supporting studies. These data are stored in the research data repository, Life Sciences Data Archive (LSDA).</r3d:description>
